    },
    {
      "id": "song-788",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "踏莎行",
      "subtitle": "雨霁风光春分天",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "雨霁风光，春分天气。\n千花百草争明媚。\n画梁新燕一双双，玉笼鹦鹉爱孤睡。\n薜荔依墙，莓苔满地。\n青楼几处歌声丽。\n蓦然旧事上心头，无言敛皱眉山翠。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b2042b6939da050762e3053f5b5a2dfc074fd0424ef529ee613e9daf231d7ee2",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-788--b2042b6939da050762e3053f5b5a2dfc074fd0424ef529ee613e9daf231d7ee2.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-789",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "踏莎行",
      "subtitle": "夜雨朝晴东风微",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "夜雨朝晴，东风微冷。\n雕梁燕子闲相并。\n后园次第数芳菲，千香百艳年年定。\n步险楼高，人赊途迥。\n烟芜冉冉斜阳暝。\n红笺写尽寄无因，想伊不信人成病。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "a9c363baf5fd8016642a45ba81652c07fcc34f92124d218ec6f9e009973363d6",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-789--a9c363baf5fd8016642a45ba81652c07fcc34f92124d218ec6f9e009973363d6.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-790",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "踏莎行",
      "subtitle": "嫩柳成阴残花双",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "嫩柳成阴，残花双舞。\n尘消院落新经雨。\n洞房深掩日长天，珠帘时有沈烟度。\n夜梦凄凉，晨妆薄注。\n香肌瘦尽宽金缕。\n到头终是恶因缘，当初只被多情误。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "44b26f98b692eaf6aa9440a4117d214ccafebc9410cf5284a8582d697d6bdcde",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-790--44b26f98b692eaf6aa9440a4117d214ccafebc9410cf5284a8582d697d6bdcde.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-791",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "踏莎行",
      "subtitle": "闲院秋千又还拆",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "闲院秋千，又还拆了。\n绿苔遍地青春老。\n画楼日晚燕归巢，红稀翠盛梅初小。\n窈窕身轻，怎禁烦恼。\n罗衣渐减怯风峭。\n韶华好景想多才，厌厌只为书音少。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "4320cf4f6d8f763b9018943c861edb18474fae52bae4791f8ac6ce8199dd54d1",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-791--4320cf4f6d8f763b9018943c861edb18474fae52bae4791f8ac6ce8199dd54d1.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-792",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "菩萨蛮",
      "subtitle": "游丝欲堕还重上",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "游丝欲堕还重上。\n春残日永人相望。\n花共燕争飞。\n青梅细雨枝。\n离愁终未解。\n忘了依前在。\n拟待不寻思。\n刚眠梦见伊。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "118645d3d3c959da99fdb122cdb27254ffbbca0c706622e746b04ef28387a19d",
      "estimatedOutput": 718,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-792--118645d3d3c959da99fdb122cdb27254ffbbca0c706622e746b04ef28387a19d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-793",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "菩萨蛮",
      "subtitle": "锦机织了相思字",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "锦机织了相思字。\n天涯路远无由寄。\n寒雁只衔芦。\n何曾解寄书。\n缄封和血泪。\n目断西江水。\n拟欲托双鱼。\n问君情有无。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "31c454e1e9512cbb972294a86ce902ff2332e6ec899b5f918ee5d934bcc0356b",
